@startuml
title Customer Activation Synchronization

actor "Customer Operations" as Ops
participant "Customer Onboarding Portal" as Portal
participant "Customer Onboarding Service" as Service
participant "Integration Event Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Policy Administration" as Policy

Ops -> Portal : Approve onboarding request
Portal -> Service : submitApprovedActivation(customer_id, correlation_id)
Service -> Service : Create Customer Activation Profile
Service -> Runtime : publish customer.activated
Runtime -> Policy : deliver activation event
Policy --> Runtime : acknowledge activation accepted
Runtime --> Service : delivery success
Service --> Portal : activation accepted
Portal --> Ops : activation status visible

note over Service,Runtime
Every activation event includes a correlation_id
for end-to-end traceability and replay support.
end note

@enduml
